ly works if the module is enabled. If it's disabled, all the regex functionality is removed and the checkbox disappears. The substitution syntax supports three replacement constructs: `$$` becomes `$`, `$<number>` (like `$1`) gets replaced with the capture group's contents by index (0 is whole match), and `${name}` gets replaced with the capture group's contents by name (e.g. for patterns like `(?<name>.*?)`).\r\n\r\nCoincidentally, since the regex compilation error needs to be shown to the user, I also added a `RegEx::get_compilation_error` function, bound it, and documented it to close one of my really old proposals.\r\n\r\nCloses godotengine/godot-proposals#8384\r\nCloses godotengine/godot-proposals#10721\r\nCloses godotengine/godot-proposals#7995\r\nPartially closes godotengine/godot-proposals#9778 (not exposed as a theme item, but you can manipulate the text paragraph objects directly now)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-11-20T12:41:40Z","updated_at":"2026-05-01T06:55:49Z","closed_at":"2026-05-01T0